  "comment": "Sumber: https://www.arduino.cc/en/Tutorial/InputPullupSerial This example demonstrates the use of INPUT_PULLUP with pinMode(). It monitors the state of a switch by establishing serial communication between your Arduino and your computer over USB. Additionally, when the input is HIGH, the onboard LED attached to pin 13 will turn on; when LOW, the LED will turn off. Contents 1 Hardware Required 2",
